The revised monthly fellowship amount for a WISE-PhD fellow is Rs. 37,000/-. 

For the Project Associate – II/SRF position under the SERB POWER GRANT PROJECT at Jadavpur University, the payment structure includes:
- JRF (One year): Rs. 38,440/- per month {Rs. 31,000 + HRA (24%)}
- SRF (Four Months): Rs. 43,400/- per month {Rs. 35,000 + HRA (24%)}

Thus, the fellowship for a Project Associate – II/SRF under the SERB POWER GRANT PROJECT at Jadavpur University is higher than that of a WISE-PhD fellow in terms of monthly payment structure.
